<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malachi Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malachi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mal.</para>
  <para style="mt">Malachi</para>
  <para style="mt">Malachi Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide caihakecibe Malachi samdung raupwala, pa century mengeibe BC kekamle lung, kerecaki teidai kelucai Jewme renet teilung petau ga la tadi penui sangmepuidung de laktak lu, penui Tinggwang de mapeu luta di, nah pecu de pütdi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malachi lungnei kedibe cai Israelme Tinggwang de ngngwa kelung petau luta kedide. Penui Tinggwang de nsungta di nah pecu rüt kemakta teidi. Penui Tinggwang teilu lobe teilu tadi. Aide ziemne, tutiak bam zie, dede Tinggwang mie hing kelame ngngi la bui ma kedanemene penui au Tinggwang laisiukwak ge le nah Tinggwang gu kelikelu de kelungta kehega eh lazie kecune.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang Israel de keku (1:1-5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel Tinggwang de kekii (1:6-2:16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tinggwang tutiak nah sampet (2:17-4:6)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Jacob de Hung, Esau de Nseu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 1:1" />Sam aide RAMPAUBE Israelme dage rang beulo caihakecibe Malachi dage kaibeu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 9:13</char></note>.<verse eid="MAL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 1:2" />“Ih nnuide hungbam la,” de RAMPAUBE rang. Dede nnui rang eh, “Nang dainzwa anuide hungbam lano?” “Esau de Jacob sinabe meni?” RAMPAUBE ranggai. “Iciude Ih Jacob de hungdi, <verse eid="MAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 1:3" />dede Esau de Ih ngau ngkaudi. Ih pe lamlwatudung de gidi, nah Ih pe deudung de renaamkang teibeu dida maiseurungdung ziemne.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:13">Rom. 9:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 1:4" />Magade Esau leuhme Edomme de, “Anui namdi de tei ngkap dida, dede anui ngkap kedidung de teidai zie,” de rang cai reugwame reu RAMPAUBE anuide ranggai zie, “Penui tei ncuh dai lubui, dede Ih penuide sam nkau dai dizie. Kedame penui de, ‘Deudi ga kemaumedung’ nah ‘RAMPAUBE ne kelungta reset kedi minadung,’ de qu zie. <verse eid="MAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 1:5" />Nkatei nmiak le aide ngau zie, nah nang rang zie, ‘RAMPAUBE au Israel heriedung gwale de kengkieng bam.’”<verse eid="MAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ratak Kehereidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 1:6" />“Pena pe pei de rüt la, nah kilame ge pe mpaube de rütla. Magade Ih, pe pei lie cai, dai ga acu kerüt bam no? Magade Ih pe mpaube cai, daiga acu kehing de bam no?” de eh RAMPAUBE nnui cingkumedung de rang, a zi de mning mla kelame. “Dede nnui rang, ‘Anui dainzwa n zi de mning mla no?’ <verse eid="MAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 1:7" />Taktyei kemta be a recabam gage reca tei kegaine. Dede nnui rang, ‘Anui dainzwa ncu tei msia no?’ Rampaube taktyeibam de kemta lie de rang kecune. <verse eid="MAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 1:8" />Nnui makaunedung pemiakciet kecube reca pwapeu kecudau, cide kesiabe meni? Nnui pepi sia nah pekau yi kemakpe pwapeu kecudau, cide kesiabe meni? Nnui deuceudi de cide pwapeu lu! Pa ncu luulu zieni mede pa nzu teucuh zieni?” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ranggai. <verse eid="MAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 1:9" />Cu nnui Tinggwang de keteu bamdi, ngaugia de peu nnui da bamlu kerane. Dede reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang eh cikenzwa reca n ba ga teu eh, pa nnui hangge de teucuh beu zieni? <verse eid="MAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 1:10" />“Oh, magade nnui kak gade hangge kerecaki kiriedung de ngkuilu cai, ciciu de nnui a ratakbam ga mi ntau kegai de kemta teidi kelak ne! Ih nnuide asui meda,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang, “nah Ih nnui ba gade reca pwa kepeu be luu lak. <verse eid="MAL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 1:11" />Kedanemene tingnaimiak kepet gade nlwet cu kecang a zi heleuhdung kakga ndudie bamzie nah heni pelane ga perimkeyi nah yitube recadung a zi gade reca teizie. Kedanemene a zi heleuhdung kakga ndudie zie,” de eh RAMPAUBE ranggai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:4">Keu. 15:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 1:12" />“Dede nnui Rampaube taktyeibam de herüt peu kemak rang kecudau nnui kemau tei dida, nah pe tsi, pe taktyei, de mning mla dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 1:13" />Nnui ainzwa eh rang, ‘Dai kenzwa gede leu no,’ nah nnui cide nui kui lwa,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang. “Nnui renaamkaune mede pepi kesiabe mede pekauyi kemakpe ada teugwang; nah aide nang n reca delie eh teugwang. Ih aide n ba gade luulu zie ni?” de RAMPAUBE rang. <verse eid="MAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 1:14" />“Peu mide cwa kelabe da reset gwang eh makaune pehau gade peseu kebam nah acu pwapeu zielie sampet kebeu, deliede acu ratak teigai, Rampaube, daige mau di no! Kedanemene Ih kendu hegwangpei,” de eh RAMPAUBE rang, “nah a zi de heleuhdung kakga hetwa peu lazie.”<verse eid="MAL 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Judah Samsangkemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 2:1" />Cu nnui cingkumedung, sam aide nnui ziemne. <verse eid="MAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 2:2" />“Magade nnui kingnei mecai, nah magade nnui a zi de hetwa peu kera nnui mlung gage kailu mecai,” de eh RAMPAUBE rang, “Iciu cai Ih nnui da reset langgai zie, nah nnui samlamdung de Ih reset dizie. Kesang, Ih penuide reset dida, kedanemene nnui a samde nnui mlung gage kai nzeulu kemakne. <verse eid="MAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 2:3" />Pielo, Ih nnui leuhme da a rata gwang lai eh bam dida, nah nnui zudung gage makaune ratak tei kelu teulwe tei zang gai beuzie, nnui hengyidung gu teu, nah pa ncu de si eh keu teu dizie. <verse eid="MAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 2:4" />Ih sam aide nda ge langgai cu nang ci zie, nah a samkak de Levi da bam jüja zie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ranggai. <verse eid="MAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 2:5" />“A samkak peda kela de au teilung nah lungciep, nah Ih cidungde pecu ha beu dida; Ih pecu kehing peu dida, nah pa acu hingla, nah pa a zi teu eh sap bam. <verse eid="MAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 2:6" />Kesang rangkeliabe pe mui ga bam, nah magede petau kemakpe pe muileukung gade ngaulu ma. Pa lungciep teu acu ngngwa tetla nah makesangme ge nah pa kekieege de kemau gade teu nreu beu. <verse eid="MAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 2:7" />Kedanemene cingkube maci bam maisia nah minadung pe mui gade rangkeliabe siu maisia, kedanemene pa au reugwame reu RAMPAUBE samgwabe kecune. <verse eid="MAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 2:8" />Dede nnui kesang lampui gade nreu tetti da. Nnui keledeu kekiee gade minadung de peu kemau tei dida hezaibe de herüt peu mene. Nnui Levi samkak kelu de gileu dida,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE ranggai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:15">Jer. 18:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 2:9" />“Cine Ih liede, nnuide minadung dwa gade pemi kegah nah mi nkau kepungme ge teibeu dida, kedanemene nnui a zaidung de mzailu kemakne, dede iciu meliene rangkelia dungde nzwakap eh rang beuma kecune.”<verse eid="MAL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 2:10" />Anui pelane pei ket meni? Peibe Tinggwang ket ne anuide damgai meni? Daitei anui ketket sinabe ne kenlum bamlu meno, anui peimedung samkak de tei hera dino?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Exo 20.12-17</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 2:11" />Judah ga minadung Tinggwang de samkak kelude kainzeulu meda. Israel nah Jerusalem ga hetakesia teidi. Judahme RAMPAUBE kemci ni pa hungkela de tei hera, nah mipeidung mipui hera keda reca kelamedung de nautakdi. <verse eid="MAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 2:12" />Ih kiela peu RAMPAUBE de Jacob paiki gade cide tei kegaime de dang gi dilu, mrak kebamme nah samkeli kebamme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mrak kebamme nah samkeli kebamme </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pempaube nah laisiukecibe</char></note>, pa RAMPAUBE de reca teugwang lalie de. <verse eid="MAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 2:13" />Nangde aide teilu: RAMPAUBE recabam de nnui miakduidung ne teipui dida, kedanemene pa cude recadung de nreugwang piema mede luulu ma nnui ba gade. <verse eid="MAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 2:14" />Dede nnui rang, “Daitei RAMPAUBE anui reca luu meno?” Kedanemene RAMPAUBE n nau nnai kakga hena kebamdau ci kebamne, cau dade samsang luma bi, pa samkak kelu gade n kangngwame nah n nau liede. <verse eid="MAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 2:15" />Pa penuide ket teigai meni, pe rabe kesa gade? Iciucai pa daitei nnuide ket teigai no? Kedanemene pa Tinggwang dade pe leuhme peei kelane. Cine nnuikatei nnui rabe ne gumlu, nah nnui nau de kenlum de gah diso nnui henadau de. <verse eid="MAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 2:16" />“Kedanemene Ih kelak cak kecu de nkaula,” RAMPAUBE Israelme Tinggwang rang eh, “nah cauge pe paiheni le makesia gumteula bi,” de eh RAMPAUBE rang. “Cine nnuikatei nnui rabe ne gumlu nah kenlum de gah diso.”<verse eid="MAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tutiak Tingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 2:17" />Nnui RAMPAUBE de nnui samdung ne tei leu dida. Dede nnui rang eh, “Anui dainzwa pecu tei leudi dino?” Rang eh, “Mileune kesia keteime RAMPAUBE miakngau gade keyime da, nah pa penuide pesuiyi bam,” mede “Daiga Tinggwang gu tiakkemzuibe bamno?”<verse eid="MAL 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 3:1" />Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE keligai, “Pa a ziemne lampui mtei kera, Ih a samgwabe de langgai. Pecai Rampaube, nnui peei kelabe de, cimezing eh pe kerecaki ga gwang zie. Samkak samgwabe nnui suiyi kebam de, pielo, pa gwang zie,”<verse eid="MAL 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 3:2" />Dede cau ge Rampaube kegwang benai pecu ngngei eh bamlu bui no? Cau ge pa kegwang dau sap lubui no? Kedanemene pa au mi teihemi kelu nzwa nah paiheni keheta sabu nzwa zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:17">Keu. 6:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 3:3" />Pa bam eh rangkanggeu de teihemi nah teimci zie, nah pa Levi leuhme de teimci zie. Pa kecak nah rangkanggeu nzwa teihemi zie, nah penui reca petaube RAMPAUBE da teugwang zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pet. 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 3:4" />Ciciu lude Judah nah Jerusalem ga minadung recadung de RAMPAUBE pesui luzie, ndaa nzwa, nah paupai tingdau nzwa. <verse eid="MAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 3:5" />“Pecai Ih nnui tutiak kera gwang zie. Ih zette rekame, kemmha ta keteime, kenret zierang keteime, nah hetatei kelame ziehi cwa tyei kelame, hemipui nah nggiana ziuyi cwa tyei kelame, sangme de teu nreudi kelame, nah acu herüt peulu kemakme leune de mmau dizie,” de eh RAMPAUBE rang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:4">Jas. 5:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang Gu Kesüt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 3:6" />“Cine Ih, RAMPAUBE, li dima; ciziemne nnui, Jacob leuhme, kamtu ga gwangdi mereu. <verse eid="MAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAL 3:7" />Nnui peime tingdau gade nnui hezaibe gade nreu tet dida nah cide kai mzeu lu meda. Ada caili gwanglu, nah Ih nnui da caili gwang zie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang. “Dede nnui rang eh, ‘Anui dainzwa cailigwang lulai?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAL 3:8" />Ih ncu keteu, mige Tinggwang de cwalu zieni? Iciu de nnui anuide cwabam dida. Dede nnui rang eh, ‘Anui dainzwa ncu cwa no?’ Kereizige nah hemaadung kepeu gade. <verse eid="MAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAL 3:9" />Heleuh pelane, acu cwala kedine, reset le nnuide reset beu dida. <verse eid="MAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAL 3:10" />Kereizige pelane kerecaki kibung ga teugwang lu, ciciu lude peu a kiga taktyeipwak bamlu kerane, nah cu aide ga acu kedakpie lu,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang, “Magade Ih tinggim gu kirie de nnui ngkei beu ma nah samlamdung de nnui da rui gaibeu mecai, cika kibung kemrwa cidung ziemne bamsi tadi kemaktane. <verse eid="MAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAL 3:11" />Ih nnui meibui teimsia kedime de resiu zie, ciciu lude nnui luh ga mei dungde teimsia dilak kerane. Ngu kube luhdung ga petsi ga dilak,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang. <verse eid="MAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAL 3:12" />“Heleuh pelane nnuide samlampung lie eh quzie, kedanemene nnui deu ga suiyi bam dizie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang.<verse eid="MAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAL 3:13" />“Nnui aha rangmsia eh la dida,” de eh RAMPAUBE rang. “Dede nnui rang eh, ‘Anui anui kakga daige ncu rangmsia no?’ <verse eid="MAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAL 3:14" />Nnui rangda, ‘Tinggwang tagwa tei kecu kemtage lie. Daipai kemmi ge bamno pa kerangbe mnei kelu gade mede anui suisia eh RAMPAUBE dwaga tet kela de? <verse eid="MAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAL 3:15" />Cine cu ngang kelame de samlampung lie quzie. Kesiata tei kelame lungh yi kecu rünne lama, dede penui Tinggwang de kedakpie la nah mria tetti lula.’”<verse eid="MAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAL 3:16" />Ciu eh RAMPAUBE mie hing kelame hang gege de resiu la. RAMPAUBE penui kerang de kingnei nah siula, nah RAMPAUBE mie hing nah pezi de rüt kelame dungde kensung gade laisiukwak ge pedwa gade rau pwabam. <verse eid="MAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAL 3:17" />“Penui agu dizie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang, “A katei agu hungtu kelabe, Ih teipet kecu benai. Ih penuide ngaunggia zie, pepei pekatei pena de hungla kela nzwa. <verse eid="MAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAL 3:18" />Ciciu eh pecai liede nnui kesangbe nah kesangkemakpe ci ntsam luzie, Tinggwang de reca kelame nah reca la kemakme de.<verse eid="MAL 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAL 4" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Tingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAL 4:1" />Cine pielo, pe tingba gwangla dida,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tutiak benai</char></note> miheu nzwa heubam dizie, ngang kelame nah kesiata tei kelame leune makwarie dizie. Peting gwang kela de penuide ru dizie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang, “ciciu de penui da pemaah mede pekiak bam silak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 The. 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAL 4:2" />Dede nnui a zi de hingla kelame, kesamsang tingnaimiak cuh eh pe hesiudung gade teingkei beuzie. Nnui tetpet zie, nah nnui hetumna peki gade hiak mpet kegai nzwa nding tetzie. <verse eid="MAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAL 4:3" />Cipau benai nnui kesia tei kelame de nnui dau nkau zie, kedanemene Ih teipet kecu benai penui au nnui pi kangga rebuidung nzwa dizie,” de eh reugwame reu RAMPAUBE rang.<verse eid="MAL 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAL 4:4" />“A kilabe Moses ne ledeu kebeu de nsung bamlu Israelme pelane ziemne, Ih pecu Horeb gade hezaidung nah ajadung kai kebeu de. <verse eid="MAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAL 4:5" />Pielo, Tingba kedi nah hingla kela RAMPAUBE gwang kemak dwa Ih nnui dage caihakecibe Elijah de langgai beuzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 11:14, 17:11, Mark 9:12, Luke 1:17</char></note> <verse eid="MAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAL 4:6" />Pa mipeimedung mlung de pe namedung da keu cailigwang beuzie, nah pe namedung mlung de pe peimedung da, ciciu lude Ih gwang eh nnui deu de teimsia ciak di melu kerane.”<verse eid="MAL 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAL 4" />
</usx>